{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29887","headline":"木兰 · 李商隐","name":"木兰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"二月二十二，木兰开坼初。\n初当新病酒，复自久离居。\n愁绝更倾国，惊新闻远书。\n紫丝何日障，油壁几时车。\n弄粉知伤重，调红或有余。\n波痕空映袜，烟态不胜裾。\n桂岭含芳远，莲塘属意疎。\n瑶姬与神女，长短定何如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29887.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29887","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}